      "message": "Which calling function here is expecting a 0/1 return value?  We should probably note this in the corresponding .h definition since I think a fair amount of EC code will expect zero/non-zero returns to work for truth indicators. We are trying to move towards bool in newer APIs, but there are a lot of \"int\" returns still in the codebase.",
