      "writtenOn": "2020-12-14T18:06:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One case that I see is our `extpower_is_present` implementation.\n\n```\nint extpower_is_present(void)\n{\n\tint vbus_present \u003d 0;\n\tint port;\n\n\t/*\n\t * Boards define pd_snk_is_vbus_provided() with something appropriate\n\t * for their hardware\n\t */\n\tfor (port \u003d 0; port \u003c board_get_usb_pd_port_count(); port++)\n\t\tif (pd_get_power_role(port) \u003d\u003d PD_ROLE_SINK)\n\t\t\tvbus_present |\u003d pd_snk_is_vbus_provided(port);\n\n\treturn vbus_present;\n}\n```",
      "parentUuid": "fc92d25b_14619739",
      "revId": "f1c69f9f3da12a0a647f2bbb2b5670b5ed3399f8",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
